<!-- OVERVIEW: one passage; its words darken as it is read, the shield   -->
<!-- closes when the reader reaches the end                              -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story" data-lit>
      <h2 class="story__title rv" id="s1-title">Cybersecurity Solutions for Logistics Operations and Supply Chains</h2>

      <div class="story__aside" aria-hidden="true">
        {{ icon("truck", "lg") }}
        <span class="story__rail"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="story__body">
        <p>CipherTrivia brings a security-first perspective to logistics operations where shipment tracking and fleet management systems or warehouse platforms and third-party integrations must work together without exposing critical business data. A vulnerability in any of these connected systems can create opportunities for data theft and unauthorized access or disrupt delivery schedules and supply chain coordination.</p>
        <p>Our cybersecurity solutions for the logistics industry focus on identifying exploitable weaknesses across transportation management systems (TMS) and warehouse management systems (WMS) alongside fleet applications and shipment tracking platforms. Through penetration testing and vulnerability assessments as well as application and API security testing, we help logistics businesses uncover security gaps before they affect critical operations.</p>
        <p>From reviewing remote access mechanisms to testing integrations between logistics platforms, our logistics cybersecurity services deliver actionable findings and practical remediation guidance. This helps freight operators and distribution businesses prioritize security improvements while safeguarding shipment data and supporting reliable supply chain operations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

