<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="ihead">
      <h2 class="ihead__title rv" id="s4-title">Our Logistics Cybersecurity Assessment Process</h2>
      <p class="ihead__lede rv" style="--d:1">CipherTrivia follows a structured security assessment process to uncover vulnerabilities across logistics applications and connected supply chain infrastructure while keeping operational requirements at the center of every engagement.</p>
    </header>

    <ol class="track" data-track>
      <li class="track__step rv">
        <span class="track__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ icon("compass") }}
        <h3 class="track__title">Scope Definition and System Discovery</h3>
        <p class="track__text">We identify critical logistics assets and define the assessment scope across fleet management platforms and warehouse systems alongside shipment tracking applications and network infrastructure.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="track__step rv" style="--d:1">
        <span class="track__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ icon("radar") }}
        <h3 class="track__title">Security Testing and Vulnerability Identification</h3>
        <p class="track__text">Our team conducts penetration testing and vulnerability assessments to uncover weaknesses in application security and access controls or network configurations and system integrations.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="track__step rv" style="--d:2">
        <span class="track__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ icon("gauge") }}
        <h3 class="track__title">Risk Analysis and Validation</h3>
        <p class="track__text">We validate identified vulnerabilities and evaluate their potential impact on shipment data and fleet operations or warehouse availability and supply chain continuity.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="track__step rv" style="--d:3">
        <span class="track__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ icon("route") }}
        <h3 class="track__title">Reporting and Remediation Guidance</h3>
        <p class="track__text">We deliver a detailed security report outlining validated findings and severity ratings alongside technical evidence and practical recommendations to help prioritize corrective actions.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="track__step rv" style="--d:4">
        <span class="track__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ icon("retest") }}
        <h3 class="track__title">Retesting and Security Verification</h3>
        <p class="track__text">After remediation, we retest affected systems within the agreed scope to verify fixes and identify any remaining vulnerabilities that require attention.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

