<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="ihead">
      <h2 class="ihead__title rv" id="s5-title">Compliance Frameworks We Help Logistics Companies Address</h2>
      <p class="ihead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Logistics providers handle sensitive shipment records and customer information while connecting with carriers and suppliers across complex supply chains. CipherTrivia helps organizations assess relevant security controls and identify compliance gaps through logistics cybersecurity services that support data protection and risk management.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fw-grid fw-grid--7">
      <article class="fw rv">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("badge") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">ISO 27001</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">ISO/IEC 27001</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We assess information security controls and risk management practices to identify gaps in protecting logistics data and supporting an effective Information Security Management System (ISMS).</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("radar") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">NIST</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">NIST Cybersecurity Framework</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We evaluate cybersecurity practices across asset management and protection alongside threat detection and incident response to help logistics businesses prioritize security improvements.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("shield-check") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">SOC 2</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">SOC 2</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">For logistics technology providers and cloud-based platforms, we assess relevant security controls related to data protection and system access to support SOC 2 readiness efforts.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("user-shield") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">GDPR</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">GDPR</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">For logistics companies processing personal data within the regulation's scope, we review relevant technical safeguards and access controls to identify potential data protection gaps.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("container") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">TAPA</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">TAPA Security Standards</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We assess relevant cybersecurity risks affecting logistics operations and connected systems that support secure cargo handling and supply chain processes. TAPA requirements primarily address cargo security and should not be treated as standalone cybersecurity certification.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("card") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">PCI DSS</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">PCI DSS</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">For logistics businesses processing payment card data through online portals or payment systems, we assess relevant security controls to identify gaps in protecting cardholder information.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("globe") }}</div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">Regional Data Protection Requirements</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We review applicable data protection obligations based on the locations where logistics companies operate and process personal information, helping identify technical security gaps that may require remediation.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

